## API design

- Follow the principles in `[api-overview.md](mdc:docs/api/contracts/api-overview.md)`.
- Apply versioning strategy from `[versioning-policy.md](mdc:docs/api/contracts/versioning-policy.md)`.

## Endpoint documentation

- Each module should document its endpoints in a file like `[module-name]-endpoints.md` under `docs/api/endpoints/`.
- Keep request/response schemas aligned with database schema docs under `docs/database/schema/`.

## Implementation notes

- Prefer thin route handlers delegating to well-defined services.
- Validate inputs and handle errors according to global error-handling standards.

